    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Astray\u00a0</strong>is a challenging (yet whimsical) puzzle-precision platformer that subtly and playfully touches on the struggle to find direction in one's life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty:\u00a0</strong>A minimal tutorial followed by learn-as-you-fail levels that demand creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planning: </strong>Use the game's unique <i>Planning Mode</i>\u00a0that encourages first-try success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Tokens: </strong>You're an immortal soul that can survive without health, but the tokens might be useful elsewhere...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reset Tokens: </strong>If you find yourself stuck due to an earlier misstep, use these limited tokens to restart the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goodness Meter:</strong> The purity of your soul is tracked, show them (who?) that you have more than just a good heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamps: </strong>Sacrifice soul fragments to light the lamps in your path, a gift to help guide other lost souls. If you find a lamp already lit, accept the gift for a unique power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets:</strong> Collect trinkets in hard-to-reach places to remind yourself who you are + alter game outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets: </strong>Unexpected secrets encourage you to make choices that can alter your end-goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.poster.avif?t=1754919772\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.webm?t=1754919772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.mp4?t=1754919772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You watch them ascend around you... what will you sacrifice to keep up?\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Astray\u00a0</strong>is a challenging (yet whimsical) puzzle-precision platformer that subtly and playfully touches on the struggle to find direction in one's life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty:\u00a0</strong>A minimal tutorial followed by learn-as-you-fail levels that demand creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planning: </strong>Use the game's unique <i>Planning Mode</i>\u00a0that encourages first-try success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Tokens: </strong>You're an immortal soul that can survive without health, but the tokens might be useful elsewhere...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reset Tokens: </strong>If you find yourself stuck due to an earlier misstep, use these limited tokens to restart the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goodness Meter:</strong> The purity of your soul is tracked, show them (who?) that you have more than just a good heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamps: </strong>Sacrifice soul fragments to light the lamps in your path, a gift to help guide other lost souls. If you find a lamp already lit, accept the gift for a unique power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets:</strong> Collect trinkets in hard-to-reach places to remind yourself who you are + alter game outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets: </strong>Unexpected secrets encourage you to make choices that can alter your end-goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.poster.avif?t=1754919772\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.webm?t=1754919772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.mp4?t=1754919772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You watch them ascend around you... what will you sacrifice to keep up?\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Jump, dash and use abilities granted by your immortal soul to outjump damnation in this challenging, yet whimsical, puzzle-precision platformer. Flex your creativity and precision as you overcome hand-crafted trials with minimal instruction.\u00a0",
